{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061337/block/singleImage/3254259/df/01M68R2KV7MPWWPRNVV29S4Q36.jpg?updatedAt=1793442763\"/><figcaption>黃大仙上邨爆鹹水管，2日前曾因爆水管全邨停食水。(黃大仙區友)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (31 日 ) 下午 2 時許，黃大仙上邨一條鹹水管爆裂，屋邨管理員通知水務署派員關掉喉管及搶修。 從網上圖片可見，黃大仙上邨入口處水花四濺，沿梯奴潺潺而下，保安到場拉起封鎖線，居民需繞道而行。該邨日前曾因附近爆食水管，水務署需維修而暫停食水供應。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061337/block/singleImage/3254261/df/01M68R6ZBZCTJGJ3C10S5HN6ZF.jpg?updatedAt=1793442763\"/><figcaption>黃大仙上邨爆鹹水管，2日前曾因爆水管全邨停食水。(黃大仙區友)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.494141+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T10:32:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:29.750091+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:29.750091+00:00","content_hash":"5a094410bc394c8f28ac835d96222d5f2cfd3d13f0ed000027cbf38f26672a31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}